     "updated": "2009-02-20T13:41:43.322-0400"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a49f83b8c6006bf8fa8a",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f18bfd724c6e122126a75e2bdc9c8302?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRW-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f18bfd724c6e122126a75e2bdc9c8302?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRW-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f18bfd724c6e122126a75e2bdc9c8302?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRW-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f18bfd724c6e122126a75e2bdc9c8302?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRW-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Renaud Waldura",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a49f83b8c6006bf8fa8a",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Yes yes yes! (I had logged this as ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-446#icft=FCREPO-446"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": "). I would strongly recommend using the runtime API to figure out where the Webapp lives at – rather than a configuration parameter – for 2 reasons:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "1- the runtime API is guaranteed to have the correct information",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "2- less duplicated configuration between the container and the Webapp",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I also want to mention this information is available in every request, so there may not be a need to get it at startup time.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
