       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/98e22ada0938a79eb37d48dccb0e7302?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FML-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/98e22ada0938a79eb37d48dccb0e7302?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FML-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "McClain Looney",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4d65426330072ea685d",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This needs to be fixed. </p>\n\n<p>Currently, because of this issue, only 1 Fedora can ever possibly be installed into a single servlet container. </p>\n\n<p>Furthermore, it's wrong.</p>\n\n",
     "created": "20/Feb/09 1:41 PM",
     "id": "10837",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10376/comment/10837",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a4d65426330072ea685d",
